hostapd: parse the station RM IE even without the capability bit

wpa_supplicant 2.11 adds the RM Enabled Capabilities element to its
Association Request but does not set WLAN_CAPABILITY_RADIO_MEASUREMENT in the
capability field, so hostapd drops the element and req_beacon refuses with
'does not support ... beacon report'.  A CAP that wants to relay 802.11k
reports should accept the explicit IE.

--- a/src/ap/ieee802_11.c
+++ b/src/ap/ieee802_11.c
@@ -4418,4 +4418,3 @@
-	if ((sta->capability & WLAN_CAPABILITY_RADIO_MEASUREMENT) &&
-	    elems->rrm_enabled &&
+	if (elems->rrm_enabled &&
 	    elems->rrm_enabled_len >= sizeof(sta->rrm_enabled_capa))
 		os_memcpy(sta->rrm_enabled_capa, elems->rrm_enabled,
